{
  "id": "16330_uwagaki",
  "headword": "{上書|うわが}き",
  "reading": "うわがき",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, verb (suru)",
  "gloss": "overwriting, writing over",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "overwriting, saving over existing data",
      "explanation": "Replacing existing data or content by writing new data in its place. Most commonly used in computing contexts."
    },
    {
      "sense_number": 2,
      "gloss": "address written on the outside of a letter",
      "explanation": "The name and address written on the outside of an envelope or package. A traditional usage."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "16330_uwagaki_ex1",
      "japanese": "ファイルを{上書|うわが}き{保存|ほぞん}する。",
      "english": "To save a file by overwriting it.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "16330_uwagaki_ex2",
      "japanese": "{間違|まちが}えて{上書|うわが}きしてしまった。",
      "english": "I accidentally overwrote it.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "16330_uwagaki_ex3",
      "japanese": "{大事|だいじ}なデータを{上書|うわが}きしないように{気|き}をつけてください。",
      "english": "Please be careful not to overwrite important data.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "16330_uwagaki_ex4",
      "japanese": "{封筒|ふうとう}の{上書|うわが}きを{確認|かくにん}する。",
      "english": "To check the address on the envelope.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {上書|うわが}き{保存|ほぞん}: save (overwrite) — the standard \"save\" command in Japanese computing\n- {上書|うわが}き{禁止|きんし}: write-protect, overwrite prohibited\n\nUSAGE NOTES:\nSense 1 (computing) is far more common in modern usage. The phrase {上書|うわが}き{保存|ほぞん} is equivalent to \"Save\" (as opposed to \"Save As\" = {名前|なまえ}をつけて{保存|ほぞん}).",
